        "result": "The optician says it happens to everyone. You buy two pairs and lose one within the week." },
      { "text": "Buy the cheapest pair at the petrol station", "effects": [ { "type": "money", "amount": -100 }, { "type": "flag", "flag": "reading_glasses" } ],
